  "statement": "I appreciate the collaborative spirit of the discussion. I support the merger of SAF-02 with RES-05 for a unified digital notification system, as it aligns with our goals of accountability and user awareness. I also agree with the modification of EFF-02 to limit simultaneous borrow operations to 5, which enhances security by preventing potential abuse. However, I maintain that TRU-03, which mandates data encryption for member personal information, is critical for ensuring compliance with data protection regulations and must remain unchanged. I propose merging TRU-01 and SAF-06 to simplify access control while retaining security integrity.",
